    "updated_at": "2022-09-21T13:20:30Z",
    "body": "If it's helpful, I would expect user agents to set the `duplex` to `half` when it is **not** required (i.e. when I pass in a string as the body) and then expose `duplex` as a property. This would have prevented the error in Chrome.",
